    waived: "the listener binds 127.0.0.1 only; a local process able to connect has easier ways to disturb the machine, and the 1 MiB cap still bounds each request"
  - finding: "listen.rs:308 - the 1 MiB read budget covers headers and body together, so a body within a header's length of 1 MiB is refused 400 (unverified candidate)"
    waived: "Vikunja's deliveries are a few KB; the boundary only refuses bodies near 1 MiB"
  - finding: "listen.rs:229 - a save_state failure inside a poll is reported as an unreachable Vikunja (unverified candidate)"
